  /* The tablet, as an object rather than as a screenshot.

     **This is the only border-radius on the site, and it is deliberate.** There
     is not another one outside the facade's play button, and the house rule is
     square corners, no shadows, no gradients — depth is a background step and a
     hairline. The exception holds because this radius is not a style applied to
     a surface: it is the shape of a real object, and a tablet drawn with square
     corners is a drawing of something else. It stays this narrow. If a second
     one is ever wanted somewhere, that is the moment to take this one out
     rather than to start a set. */
  .flow-device {
